# Environment template for hindsight-memorial.
#
# Copy to .env on the deployment host and fill in real values. .env is in
# .gitignore for the project; this .env.example file is the canonical
# documentation of which keys are required.
#
# Required:
#   HINDSIGHT_API_KEY        — must match the value used by the hindsight
#                              container (look in /www/dk_project/dk_app/hindsight/.env)
#   HINDSIGHT_WEBHOOK_SECRET — generate with `openssl rand -hex 32`. The same
#                              string must be configured in the Hindsight
#                              webhooks UI when creating the webhook.
#
# The compose file sets HINDSIGHT_API_URL and HINDSIGHT_MEMORIAL_LOG_FILE
# directly, so they should NOT be set here (or if they are, the compose
# values win for the container).

# --- required ---
HINDSIGHT_API_KEY=replace-with-the-same-value-the-hindsight-container-uses
HINDSIGHT_WEBHOOK_SECRET=replace-with-output-of-openssl-rand-hex-32